=== layout: one-panel

# Standard: Keep the Science Visible

@body

## Standard style: native notation and equation cells

{table-style=standard}
| Quantity | Symbol or expression | Meaning |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Null hypothesis | H~0~ | The observed counts fit the model |
| Squared deviation | x^2^ | Large deviations contribute more |
| Chi-square statistic | $\chi^2=\sum\frac{(O-E)^2}{E}$ | Compare observed and expected counts |

=== layout: one-panel

# Comparison: Distinguish Two Models

@body

## Comparison style: open rows for parallel explanations

{table-style=comparison}
| Feature | Complete dominance | Incomplete dominance |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Heterozygote | Resembles one homozygote | Has an intermediate phenotype |
| F~2~ genotype ratio | 1:2:1 | 1:2:1 |
| F~2~ phenotype ratio | 3:1 | 1:2:1 |

